                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">
If this unit is contesting an objective you do not control, this unit can use 2 **^^Fight^^** abilities this phase. After the first is used, however, this unit has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.                          <conditionGroups>
